Choose which exit a network uses

Usage:
  olr routing set [command]

Available Commands:
  default          Set the exit everything uses unless something more specific says otherwise
  traffic-counting Count how much each device uses
  via              Send one network's traffic through an exit

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for set

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr routing set [command] --help" for more information about a command.
